      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you're grappling with a profound sense of futility, where patterns of failure feel inevitable. That feeling of entropy suggests a deep-seated belief that effort is meaningless against some cosmic law. Instead of viewing it as a failing of your capacity, perhaps you can see it as a signal that the current structure—your approach, your environment, or your goals—is fundamentally incompatible with sustaining life. Acknowledging the pattern is the first step toward finding a way to rewrite the equation.",
